---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<footer id="contact" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-12 pb-10 sm:pt-16 lg:pt-20">
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6">
    <p class="eyebrow">Say hello</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-[1.08]">Have something worth building? <span class="font-serif italic font-normal muted">Let's talk.</span></h2>
    <p class="text-base muted max-w-md leading-relaxed">I'm always happy to hear about a role on your team or a project to collaborate on. Tell me what you're working on and where you think I could help.</p>
    <div class="pt-2">
      <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 min-h-[44px] text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium accent-text hover:underline underline-offset-4 font-mono" href={`mailto:${site.email}`} data-track="contact" data-project="email_click">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="1.5"></rect><path d="m3.5 6 8.5 7 8.5-7"></path></svg>
        {site.email}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-16 sm:mt-20 pt-4 border-t border-monolith-line dark:border-monolith-darkLine flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] tracking-editorial uppercase muted">
    <span>{site.name} · Singapore</span>
    <a class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[44px] hover:text-monolith-accentHover dark:hover:text-[#FB923C] underline-offset-4 hover:underline" href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
  </div>
</footer>
